  "description": "C2 runtime snapshot of public/, plus the C1 hub scripts and the C4 authoritative client (public/js/net-hub.js). Six lossless fighter atlases were added and the 240 pose PNGs were kept as unused sources. Startup preload is the six atlases plus stage 01 and stage 05 scenery (10 images). Gzip-9 uses mtime 0. Decoded cost is width * height * 4 and still counts the unused pose files on disk. The vendored SDK IIFE is copied into dist/ and is not part of this public tree. The banked HUD strings replaced the H3-C placeholder and grew the public tree by the text delta only. The crash guard (public/js/crash.js, loaded first, and the panel styles in index.html) added one critical script and its bytes. The server-restart resume retry (ZK-02) grew net-hub.js and the main.js HUD note by 6833 bytes. Controller support added public/js/gamepad.js (one more startup script) and the pad and keyboard menu code grew input.js and main.js. The Marina Anchor Relic report (hub SDK 0.6.4) grew hub-link.js and main.js by 3162 bytes, with no new file or request. The readability pass (lane warning edge, own-seat marker, hub tag under the panels) grew render.js and main.js by 1984 bytes. Caps are unchanged: title 1.5 MiB, first stage 3 MiB, 30 critical requests, 10 MiB static.",
